WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.687 --> 00:00:02.747
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I <b>speak</b> English.

2
00:00:04.149 --> 00:00:06.295
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> They <b>live</b> in a flat.

3
00:00:07.754 --> 00:00:10.558
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> My mother <b>cooks</b> fantastic food.

4
00:00:11.932 --> 00:00:14.020
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I <b>don’t drink</b> tea.

5
00:00:15.394 --> 00:00:17.740
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We <b>don’t have</b> a garden.

6
00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:21.517
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>doesn’t play</b> the guitar.